│ MAIN OUTCOME MEASURES Children\'s familiarity with kohlrabi, willingness to taste it, and attitudes toward kohlrabi  │
│ and vegetables in general. ANALYSIS Chi-square and logistic regression. RESULTS There were significantly more        │
